op network openings but that could  mean open the networks at the lower  layers let's say the basic  infrastructure rather than only focusing  on the ISP layer by that we can get the  benefit of sharing infrastructure but we  can also and as a consequence of that we  could encourage more service competition  and I think what's important is that the  service competition in the future is  going to be far more interesting than in  the past because in the Internet of  Things environment the types of services  that our products that need connectivity  the the range is going to be far wider  yes it's going to be it's going to make  a big impact isn't it in IOT I think  it's going to change everything and it's  it's it's important that both the  shareholders of the operators and the  operators themselves work with the  regulators on what we call symbiotic  solutions when returns can be made on  the investment in the operators but at  the same time the opportunity to grow  the digital economy is maximized as well  fantastic thank you very much for  joining us thank you
 

